OL,3,GNEWSAKiller who stabbed and tried to
OL,4,Arob man is jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who murdered a 19-year-old man
OL,7,Fthen asked an AI app on his phone for
OL,8,Flegal advice has been given a life
OL,9,Fsentence.
OL,11,FMusa Salih, of Greenford in London, was
OL,12,Fconvicted in October of stabbing Harley
OL,13,FPurdue seven times during a late-night
OL,14,Fattempted robbery in Chatham, Kent on 2
OL,15,FDecember 2025.
OL,17,FSalih, who Kent Police have said is an
OL,18,FEritrean national, tried to lock his
OL,19,Fvictim in a toilet in a property where
OL,20,Fthey both stayed so he could steal his
OL,21,Fmoney. Purdue died in his pregnant
OL,22,Fgirlfriend's arms.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
